flowchart TD

    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始新增商品操作)
    ClickAddButton(點擊加入商品按鈕)
    PopUpAddProduct(彈出新增商品視窗)
    FillInProductInfo(填寫商品資訊)
    ClickConfirmButton(點擊確認按鈕)
    ClickCancelButton(點擊取消按鈕)
    RequestToAddProductAPI(發送新增商品請求)
    IsSuccess{是否新增成功}
    PopUpFailed(彈出新增失敗視窗)
    ReserveInfo(保留商品資訊)
    RefreshTable(重新整理Table)
    EndPoint(新增商品操作完成)

    StartPoint --> ClickAddButton
    ClickAddButton --> PopUpAddProduct
    PopUpAddProduct --> FillInProductInfo
    FillInProductInfo --> ClickConfirmButton
    ClickConfirmButton --> RequestToAddProductAPI
    RequestToAddProductAPI --> IsSuccess
    IsSuccess -->|是| RefreshTable
    IsSuccess -->|否| PopUpFailed
    PopUpFailed --> ReserveInfo
    ReserveInfo --> EndPoint
    RefreshTable --> EndPoint
    StartPoint --> ClickCancelButton
    ClickCancelButton --> EndPoint